{"id":"P079-2","subject":"P","unit":"P079","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P079-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n전력계통에서 사용하는 애자에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 정전용량이 크고 습기를 잘 흡수하지 않아야 한다.\n\n② 절연저항이 크고 누설전류가 작아야 한다.\n\n③ 절연내력이 커야한다.\n\n④ 전기적 열화현상이 나타나지 않아야 한다.\n\n⑤ 내열성이 커야한다","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":642}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n이도에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 전선 지지점간을 연결하는 수평선으로부터 밑으로 내려가\n\n  있는 길이를 의미한다.\n\n② 이도는 수평하중에 비례한다.\n\n③ 이도가 너무 크면 전선이 좌우로 크게 진동해서 다른\n\n  상의 전선과 접촉할 수 있다.\n\n④ 이도가 너무 작으면 전선의 장력이 증가하여 심할 경우\n\n  전선이 단선될 수 있다.\n\n⑤ 이도의 대소는 지지물의 높이를 좌우한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1610}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n다음 중 코로나 현상의 특징이 아닌 것은?\n\n\n① 코로나 임계전압은 직류30kVcm, 교류21kVcm\n\n  이다.\n\n② 페란티 현상이 방지되어 수전단 전압이 송전단 전압보다\n\n  높아지지 않는다.\n\n③ 송전효율과 송전용량이 증가된다.\n\n④ 코로나에 의한 화학작용으로 인해 전선 및 애자의 금속\n\n  부분의 부식이 발생한다.\n\n⑤ 소호리액터의 소호능력이 저하된다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":272},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m28-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n중성점 접지방식 중에서 직접접지 방식의 특징으로 옳지\n\n않은 것은?\n\n\n① 금속선으로 중성점을 직접접지하는 방식이다.\n\n② 1선 지락시 건전상의 대지전압 상승이 적으며, 평상시와\n\n  비슷하게 유지된다.\n\n③ 1선 지락시 통신선 유도장해가 작다.\n\n④ 애자련의 부담이 적이지며, 단절연이 가능하다.\n\n⑤ 절연레벨이 작고, 보호계전기의 동작이 확실하다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":583},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m29-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1471}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n변압기에 설치하는 보호계전기의 종류가 아닌 것은?\n\n\n① 비율차동계전기    ② 브흐홀츠계전기\n\n③ 충격압력계전기    ④ 주파수계전기\n\n⑤ 온도계전기","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":423},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":411}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n단권 변압기의 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 1차측의 영향이 2차측에 미치지 않는다.\n\n② 동손이 적고 효율이 좋다.\n\n③ 전압변동률이 작다.\n\n④ 누설 리액턴스가 작다.\n\n⑤ 1차와 2차가 공통된 권선을 사용한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":503},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":951}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n변전소의 설비 중 부하전류가 흐르지 않는 전로만을 차단\n\n할 수 있는 설비는?\n\n\n① 기중차단기      ② 계전기\n\n③ 단로기        ④ 리클로저\n\n⑤ 비동기조상기","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":375},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":931}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n3상 Y결선 부하의 상전압이 110V일 때, 선간전압은 약\n\n몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 150         ② 160\n\n③ 170         ④ 180\n\n⑤ 190","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1244}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n자체 인덕턴스가 0.5H 인 코일에 10A 의 전류를 흘릴\n\n때, 코일에 축적되는 에너지J는?\n\n\n① 25          ② 20\n\n③ 15          ④ 10\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m34-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":638}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n영상분 전압이 150V 정상분 전압이 580V, 역상분 전\n\n압이 290V일 때, 전압불평형률은?\n\n\n① 50          ② 40\n\n③ 30          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 10","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m35-q.webp","width":678,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":579}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n인덕턴스가 H 인 인덕터 3개를 병렬로 접속하였을 때,\n\n합성 인덕턴스H는?\n\n\n               \n①           ② \n\n③           ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":650},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":744}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n어떤 회로망의 4단자 정수가 , , \n\n일 때, 이 회로망의 는?\n\n\n①         ② \n\n③         ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m37-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":560}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n수동소자 , , 가 병렬로 연결된 회로가 공진상태가\n\n되었을 때, 공진주파수Hz는?\n\n\n                              \n①            ②  \n\n                  \n③            ④  \n\n     \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m38-q.webp","width":696,"height":590},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m38-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1043}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n과 가 병렬로 구성된 회로에서 역률은?\n\n\n                               \n①            ②  \n\n                    \n③            ④ \n\n     \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m39-e1.webp","width":678,"height":839}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n저항이8Ω, 용량성 리액턴스가 Ω인 직렬\n\n회로에서 100V, 60Hz의 전원을 인가하였을 때 10A \n\n가 흘렀다. 이 경우, 용량성 리액턴스Ω는?\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 6           ④ 8\n\n⑤ 10","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m40-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m40-e1.webp","width":696,"height":864}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n3상 V결선의 선간전압과 선전류는 상전압과 상전류의 몇\n\n배인가?\n\n\n\n       선간전압         선전류\n ①                           \n ②                               \n ③                               \n\n ④                                   \n\n ⑤                                   ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m41-q.webp","width":678,"height":559},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m41-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1018}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n전압을 인가할 때, 전하를 축적하는 기능을 갖는 수동소자\n\n는 무엇인가?\n\n\n① 컨덕턴스       ② 인덕턴스\n\n③ 커패시턴스      ④ 레지스턴스\n\n⑤ 어드미턴스","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m42-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m42-e1.webp","width":678,"height":388}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n시간함수 의 라플라스 변환은?\n\n\n                           \n①           ②                               \n\n                           \n③           ④                               \n\n    \n⑤     ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m43-q.webp","width":696,"height":675},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m43-e1.webp","width":678,"height":874}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n\n직렬회로에서 인가되는 전압을 입력, 에 걸리는 전압\n\n을 출력이라 할 때, 전달함수는?\n\n\n                  \n①            ②  \n\n                   \n③            ④  \n\n       \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m44-q.webp","width":696,"height":565},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m44-e1.webp","width":678,"height":621}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 시정수는 시스템의 단위계단 응답에서 정상값의 (        )\n\n 에 달할 때의 시간을 s로 표시한 것이다.\n\n\n\n① 43.2         ② 53.2\n\n③ 63.2         ④ 73.2\n\n⑤ 83.2","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m45-q.webp","width":678,"height":638},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m45-e1.webp","width":696,"height":858}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n단위 계단응답이 최종값의 10에서 90로 상승하는데\n\n필요한 시간을 무엇이라 하는가?\n\n\n① 응답시간       ② 상승시간\n\n③ 지연시간       ④ 과도시간\n\n⑤ 최대시간","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m46-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m46-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1024}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 47번","searchText":" 47\n\n신호흐름선도에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 출력이 입력을 포함한 함수로 표현되도록 구성된다.\n\n② 선형시스템에만 적용할 수 있다.\n\n③ 마디는 가지를 통해 다른 마디와 연결되어 신호흐름을\n\n  나타낸다.\n\n④ 가지는 항상 왼쪽에서 오른쪽으로 표시한다..\n\n⑤ 가지는 화살표 방향으로만 진행된다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m47","number":47},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m47-q.webp","width":678,"height":642},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m47-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1469}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 48번","searchText":" 48\n\n이상적인 연산증폭기(Op-Amp)에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 이득은 ∞이다.\n\n② 에서 로 가는 전류는 없다.\n\n③ 와 사이에 임피던스가 작다.\n\n④ 입력전류는 이다.\n\n⑤ 출력측의 저항은 이다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2025p2-e01-m48","number":48},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m48-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e01-m48-e1.webp","width":678,"height":413}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P079-S2-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 49번","searchText":" 49\n\n조절부 동작에 따른 분류에서 미분제어에 대한 설명으로\n\n옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 자체 제어를 할 수 없어 비례제어와 같이 사용한다.\n\n② 오차의 변화율이 따라 동작하여 오차가 커지는 것을\n\n  사전에 방지한다.\n\n③ 응답속응성을 개선한다.\n\n④ 외란 발생에 대한 반응속도가 느린 특징이 있다.\n\n⑤ 목표량과 오차값을 비교하여 오차와 반대 기울기의\n\n  조작량을 준다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.03 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","origina